  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_01",
      "hash64": "EA9DF8A57A95E017",
      "text": "行了行了！站住！[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_01",
      "hash64": "C01FE0B0C3FE6700",
      "text": "这前面是我们\\n天星队恶帮班……\\r\\n通称阁道二小队基地。[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_02",
      "hash64": "EA9DF9A57A95E1CA",
      "text": "对，所以拜托不要擅自闯进！[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_02",
      "hash64": "C01FE3B0C3FE6C19",
      "text": "对不起啊，如果你不回去的话，\\n我们就必须要赶走你了。[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_03",
      "hash64": "EA9DFAA57A95E37D",
      "text": "咦～？莫非，\\n你是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]？[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_04",
      "hash64": "EA9DF3A57A95D798",
      "text": "就是向我们天星队挑战，\\n正被通缉中的那个家伙？[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "8681C990FFF42607",
      "text": "可能是",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "8681CA90FFF427BA",
      "text": "不是！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_03",
      "hash64": "C01FE2B0C3FE6A66",
      "text": "哦，可能是啊……？\\n你这么率直，吓我一跳。[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_04",
      "hash64": "C01FE5B0C3FE6F7F",
      "text": "越是正在被通缉的家伙，\\n越是会坚决否认……！[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_05",
      "hash64": "EA9DF4A57A95D94B",
      "text": "不管你是谁，都赶快回去！\\n否则你就要被我打得落荒而逃了！[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_03",
      "hash64": "8681CB90FFF4296D",
      "text": "我会赢的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_04",
      "hash64": "8681C490FFF41D88",
      "text": "我回去……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_05",
      "hash64": "C01FE4B0C3FE6DCC",
      "text": "那好，快回去吧。\\n今天星苦了～！[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_06",
      "hash64": "EA9DF5A57A95DAFE",
      "text": "嗯～？太狂妄了！\\n我要痛扁你，让你知道我的厉害！[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_07",
      "hash64": "EA9DF6A57A95DCB1",
      "text": "嗯～！好不甘心～！[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_08",
      "hash64": "EA9DEFA57A95D0CC",
      "text": "接下来就拜托前辈你了！[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_09",
      "hash64": "EA9DF0A57A95D27F",
      "text": "那么，今天星苦了～！[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_06",
      "hash64": "C01FE7B0C3FE72E5",
      "text": "今天星苦了～……[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_07",
      "hash64": "C01FE6B0C3FE7132",
      "text": "…………[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_08",
      "hash64": "C01FE9B0C3FE764B",
      "text": "她是最近加入的，\\n态度实在是不行啊……[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_09",
      "hash64": "C01FE8B0C3FE7498",
      "text": "……哎～[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_10",
      "hash64": "C01C7BB0C3FB858A",
      "text": "我现在要回基地\\n联系伙伴了。[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_11",
      "hash64": "C01C7CB0C3FB873D",
      "text": "告诉你，大家会倾巢而出的。\\n你逃也好不逃也好，总之加油吧。[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_12",
      "hash64": "C01C79B0C3FB8224",
      "text": "今天星苦了～！[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
